1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,447
In this tutorial, a System Admin
provisions a new

2
00:00:03,447 --> 00:00:06,894
organisation and chooses the optional
features it can use.

3
00:00:06,894 --> 00:00:09,193
Open Settings, then Organisations under
Administration.

4
00:00:09,193 --> 00:00:12,257
The list shows every organisation on the
platform,

5
00:00:12,257 --> 00:00:15,321
with its address, tax registration number,
and status.

6
00:00:15,321 --> 00:00:18,768
Before you create anything, search for the
planned name.

7
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:21,832
Nothing comes back, so the name is free

8
00:00:21,832 --> 00:00:24,514
and you will not create a duplicate.

9
00:00:24,514 --> 00:00:26,046
Select Provision New Organisation.

10
00:00:26,046 --> 00:00:29,493
Enter the organisation name, Palm Vista
Real Estate, then

11
00:00:29,493 --> 00:00:32,940
the office address, the TRN, and the phone
number.

12
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:36,387
These details appear on receipts and
contracts, so enter

13
00:00:36,387 --> 00:00:39,835
them exactly as they appear on the trade
licence.

14
00:00:39,835 --> 00:00:43,665
Ticket Closure OTP is on by default:
tenants share a

15
00:00:43,665 --> 00:00:47,112
one-time code before a maintenance ticket
can be closed.

16
00:00:47,112 --> 00:00:48,261
Select Create Organisation.

17
00:00:48,261 --> 00:00:51,325
Palm Vista Real Estate joins the list with

18
00:00:51,325 --> 00:00:54,007
its own ID and the status Active.

19
00:00:54,007 --> 00:00:57,071
Now open Feature Toggles for the new
organisation.

20
00:00:57,071 --> 00:00:58,986
Every optional feature starts off.

21
00:00:58,986 --> 00:01:01,667
Listings publishes vacant units to the
marketplace.

22
00:01:01,667 --> 00:01:05,880
Meetings and Scheduling lets tenants book
meetings with the property team.

23
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,795
Email Notifications sends supported
emails.

24
00:01:07,795 --> 00:01:10,860
Contract Renewals and Reminders handles
contract renewal reminders.

25
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:15,073
Gate Passes and Security runs visitor
passes and the Security app.

26
00:01:15,073 --> 00:01:16,988
Mobile finance screens stays off.

27
00:01:16,988 --> 00:01:20,818
Turn on only what the organisation has
signed up for;

28
00:01:20,818 --> 00:01:24,266
here, Meetings and Scheduling, and Gate
Passes and Security.

29
00:01:24,266 --> 00:01:27,713
Each switch saves as soon as you select
it.

30
00:01:27,713 --> 00:01:32,309
Close the panel and open it again: both
features are still on.

31
00:01:32,309 --> 00:01:36,522
Next, open the organisation switcher and
choose Palm Vista Real Estate.

32
00:01:36,522 --> 00:01:39,587
The switcher now names it, and the
dashboard

33
00:01:39,587 --> 00:01:42,651
is empty, with no properties or contracts
yet.

34
00:01:42,651 --> 00:01:46,098
Back on Organisations, Edit opens the same
form, so

35
00:01:46,098 --> 00:01:49,545
legal details can be corrected later with
Save Changes.

36
00:01:49,545 --> 00:01:53,758
Deactivate asks for confirmation first:
everyone in the organisation is signed

37
00:01:53,758 --> 00:01:57,589
out and cannot sign in until it is
activated again.

38
00:01:57,589 --> 00:01:58,355
Cancel both.

39
00:01:58,355 --> 00:02:02,568
The organisation is ready for its users,
properties, and tenancy contracts.
